{"step_index":1965,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:00:01Z","thinking":"The HTML form utilizes `GET` requests to the current page URL because `action` and `method` attributes are absent. This suggests the query parameters will be appended to the URL. Further investigation requires testing different parameter combinations, like `area` and `query`, to determine the form's behavior. A test with encoded query string, specifically '디자인에코,' should provide insight into parameter handling.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Test Bizno query with area parameter\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const https = require('https');\\n\\nfunction testBizno(query, area = '') {\\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\\n    const url = `https://bizno.net/?area=${encodeURIComponent(area)}&query=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`;\\n    https.get(url, {\\n      headers: {\\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',\\n        'Accept': 'text/html,application/xhtml+xml',\\n        'Accept-Language': 'ko-KR,ko;q=0.9'\\n      }\\n    }, res => {\\n      let d = '';\\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\\n      res.on('end', () => {\\n        // extract table or titles\\n        const titles = d.match(/<h5[^>]*>[\\\\s\\\\S]*?<\\\\/h5>/gi) || [];\\n        const links = d.match(/\\\\/article\\\\/[0-9]+/g) || [];\\n        resolve({ status: res.statusCode, len: d.length, titles: titles.map(t => t.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim()), links: [...new Set(links)] });\\n      });\\n    });\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nasync function run() {\\n  console.log('Test \\\"디자인에코\\\":', await testBizno('디자인에코'));\\n  console.log('Test \\\"피커스튜디오\\\":', await testBizno('피커스튜디오'));\\n}\\n\\nrun();\\n\"","Description":"\"Test Bizno search with area and query\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/test_bizno_query2.js\"","toolAction":"\"Testing Bizno query params\"","toolSummary":"\"Test Bizno query params\""}}]}
