{"step_index":1969,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:00:12Z","thinking":"The initial search for \"디자인에코\" yielded a direct hit, confirming the data association between the search term, an article ID, and specific company details from row 639. The Bizno search URL format was also successfully identified. The next step is to use this confirmed approach to search for the remaining unknown companies.\n\n\nAddresses within the provided data suggest a concentration of companies in Centum City, Busan's tech hub. This observation raises the hypothesis that the Bizno search, when provided with Centum City-based addresses, will yield more direct results. The next step is to test the Bizno search with specific company addresses from Centum City.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Test searching some of the 229 blank companies on Bizno\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const https = require('https');\\n\\nfunction searchBizno(query, area = '부산') {\\n  return new Promise((resolve) => {\\n    const url = `https://bizno.net/?area=${encodeURIComponent(area)}&query=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`;\\n    https.get(url, {\\n      headers: {\\n        'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/120.0.0.0 Safari/537.36',\\n        'Accept': 'text/html,application/xhtml+xml',\\n        'Accept-Language': 'ko-KR,ko;q=0.9'\\n      }\\n    }, res => {\\n      let d = '';\\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\\n      res.on('end', () => {\\n        // extract article links\\n        const matches = d.match(/\\\\/article\\\\/[0-9]+/g) || [];\\n        resolve([...new Set(matches)]);\\n      });\\n    }).on('error', () => resolve([]));\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nasync function testSample() {\\n  const sampleNames = [\\n    '메타블루', '그리드파트너스', '시그마씨앤에스', '에스랩', '에코비티',\\n    '나원디앤씨', '도서출판일광', '동아대학교출판부', '동화사', '단디콤'\\n  ];\\n\\n  for (const name of sampleNames) {\\n    const res = await searchBizno(name, '부산');\\n    console.log(`Query \\\"${name}\\\" (부산): found ${res.length} articles -> ${res.slice(0, 3).join(', ')}`);\\n    if (res.length === 0) {\\n      const resAll = await searchBizno(name, '');\\n      console.log(`  Retry without area: found ${resAll.length} articles -> ${resAll.slice(0, 3).join(', ')}`);\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n\\ntestSample();\\n\"","Description":"\"Test searching sample blank companies on Bizno\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2/scratch/test_blanks_bizno.js\"","toolAction":"\"Testing blank search on Bizno\"","toolSummary":"\"Test blank search Bizno\""}}]}
